  { title: 'Torque on the tilted top', narr: 'With the top at rest in the diagram, gravity Mg acts down at CM, and τ = r × Mg points tangentially. Notice τ is perpendicular to L — that is why L can only change direction.', th: 30, tau: 1, play: false },
